    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d853">

                <pb facs="0731" n="721" xml:id="pg721"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 Strong, Robert C.: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Strong</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of state
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hong Kong</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-12-16T16:00:00+08:00">December 16,
                            1949—4 p. m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received December 16—9:39 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Cantel 1337. Reference Cantel 1336, December 15, repeated Taipei 247. Am
                    proceeding Taipei with O’Grady on SS <hi rendition="#italic">Shenking</hi>,
                    departing Hong Kong December 20, arriving Keelung December 22.</p>
                <p>Request Department circularize interested posts to direct telegraphic
                    communications for Embassy to Taipei from December 19. Sent Department Cantel
                    1337, repeated Taipei 248.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Strong</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
